---
const whatsappUrl =
  "https://wa.me/5561999195497?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C%20estive%20no%20site%20e%20gostaria%20de%20agendar%20uma%20consulta.";
---

<section id="depoimentos" class="testimonials" aria-labelledby="testimonials-title">
  <div class="testimonials-copy" data-reveal>
    <p class="testimonials-pill"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span> DEPOIMENTOS DE PACIENTES</p>
    <p class="rating">Médica com <strong>5 estrelas</strong> no <span class="google-g" aria-label="Google">G</span><span class="stars" aria-label="5 de 5 estrelas">★★★★★</span></p>
    <h2 id="testimonials-title" class="rd-title">O que pacientes<br />dizem após o<br />atendimento.</h2>
    <p class="testimonial-description">Os depoimentos de nossos pacientes refletem não apenas os resultados dos tratamentos, mas também a atenção, respeito e dedicação da Dra. Raffaela Drumond em cada etapa do cuidado com a saúde dos pacientes.</p>
    <a class="rd-button" href={whatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span>AGENDAR AVALIAÇÃO MÉDICA</span><span class="button-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .testimonials {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    height: 853px;
    padding: 100px 88px 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--bg) url("/clones/raffaeladrumond-com-br/images/Frame-44.png") center top / cover no-repeat;
  }

  .testimonials-copy { width: 498px; }

  .testimonials-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 20px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 274px;
    max-width: 100%;
    min-height: 56px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(30, 35, 15, .18);
    border-radius: 100px;
    color: var(--fg-2);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .testimonials-pill span {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-size: 23px;
    line-height: 0;
  }

  .rating {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    margin: 25px 0 0;
    color: #101010;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .google-g {
    margin-left: 4px;
    color: #4285f4;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .stars {
    color: #ff9f00;
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .testimonials .rd-title {
    margin-top: 4px;
    color: var(--fg);
    font-size: 64px;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .testimonial-description {
    margin: 20px 0 0;
    color: #101010;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .testimonials .rd-button {
    position: relative;
    width: 465px;
    min-height: 96px;
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding: 26px 100px 26px 60px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-on);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .button-arrow {
    position: absolute;
    right: 60px;
    display: grid;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--fg-2);
    font-size: 25px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  @media (max-width: 719px) {
    .testimonials {
      height: auto;
      min-height: 780px;
      padding: 72px 22px 60px;
      background-position: 64% top;
    }

    .testimonials-copy { width: auto; }

    .testimonials-pill {
      min-height: 46px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      font-size: 9px;
    }

    .rating {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 22px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .testimonials .rd-title {
      margin-top: 16px;
      font-size: 47px;
      line-height: 1.08;
    }

    .testimonial-description {
      margin-top: 22px;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .testimonials .rd-button {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 80px;
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 18px 64px 18px 22px;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .button-arrow {
      right: 20px;
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      font-size: 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
